Severity: WARN
Category: kernel
Check: check_mac
Fix: Turn PaX softmode off (kernel.pax.softmode=0).
References: paxctl(1)
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST AC-3(3); ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

PaX is in softmode: the exploit mitigation is compiled in and
switched off, so nothing is hardened by default. Turn softmode
off, unless chosen binaries carry their own PaX flags.
